, and how we optimized the model in a recent blog post.<p>Code, demos, and release details are here: https:&#x2F;&#x2F;over.world&#x2F;blog&#x2F;the-immersion-gap", "title": "Waypoint 1.1, a local-first world model for interactive simulation", "updated_at": "2026-03-05T23:27:17Z"}, {"_highlightResult": {"author": {"matchLevel": "none", "matchedWords": [], "value": "mfiguiere"}, "title": {"fullyHighlighted": false, "matchLevel": "full", "matchedWords": ["world", "model"], "value": "CWM: An Open-Weights LLM for Research on Code Generation with <em>World</em> <em>Models</em>"}, "url": {"fullyHighlighted": false, "matchLevel": "full", "matchedWords": ["world", "model"], "value": "https://ai.meta.com/research/publications/cwm-an-open-weights-llm-for-research-on-code-generation-with-<em>world</em>-<em>models</em>/"}}, "_tags": ["story", "author_mfiguiere", "story_45366370"], "author": "mfiguiere", "created_at": "2025-09-24T21:49:31Z", "created_at_i": 1758750571, "num_comments": 0, "objectID": "45366370", "points": 14, "story_id": 45366370, "title": "CWM: An Open-Weights LLM for Research on Code Generation with World Models", "updated_at": "2026-03-05T22:43:46Z", "url": "https://ai.meta.com/research/publications/cwm-an-open-weights-llm-for-research-on-code-generation-with-world-models/"}, {"_highlightResult": {"author": {"matchLevel": "none", "matchedWords": [], "value": "ilreb"}, "title": {"fullyHighlighted": false, "matchLevel": "full", "matchedWords": ["world", "model"], "value": "OpenWAM: An Open Framework for Composable <em>World</em>-Action <em>Models</em>"}, "url": {"matchLevel": "none", "matchedWords": [], "value": "https://openwam.stanford.edu/"}}, "_tags": ["story", "author_ilreb", "story_49987679"], "author": "ilreb", "children": [49989352, 49990113, 49990139], "created_at": "2026-10-07T03:17:49Z", "created_at_i": 1791343069, "num_comments": 1, "objectID": "49987679", "points": 12, "story_id": 49987679, "title": "OpenWAM: An Open Framework for Composable World-A